              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Headline",
                  "text": "You get about twelve minutes with your doctor. Don't spend eight of them remembering.",
                  "level": "h1"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Text",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "html": "<p>A free one-page checklist to take to your next appointment — so you walk out having said the thing you actually came to say.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Form",
                  "formFields": ["email"],
                  "formSubmitText": "Send me the checklist"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Text",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "html": "<p>No spam. Unsubscribe any time.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tone": "pain",
      "backgroundImageDescription": null,
      "rows": [
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Headline",
                  "text": "You know something has changed. Getting someone else to agree is the harder part.",
                  "level": "h2"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Text",
                  "textAlign": null,
                  "html": "<p>The problem usually isn't that you can't explain it. It's that you're asked to explain months of it, from memory, in a room, in about twelve minutes.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "BulletList",
                  "items": [
                    "Symptoms that don't line up into one tidy explanation",
                    "Appointments that end before you've said the main thing",
                    "Being told it's stress, or sleep, or just getting older",
                    "Months of noticing, and nothing written down to point at",
                    "Walking back to the car with the good question still unasked"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tone": "feature",
      "backgroundImageDescription": null,
      "rows": [
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Headline",
                  "text": "What's on the page",
                  "level": "h2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 4,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Card",
                  "text": "A symptom baseline",
                  "html": "<p>What changed, when it started, and how often it happens — in one place instead of five half-remembered examples.</p>",
                  "imageDescription": "clipboard checklist",
                  "subText": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": 4,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Card",
                  "text": "Dates, not adjectives",
                  "html": "<p>Room to write the specifics, so <strong>a while</strong> becomes something a clinician can actually read.</p>",
                  "imageDescription": "calendar dates",
                  "subText": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": 4,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Card",
                  "text": "Questions worth having ready",
                  "html": "<p>Including the follow-up that changes the direction of most appointments when the first answer is no.</p>",
                  "imageDescription": "speech bubble question mark",
                  "subText": null
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tone": "plain",
      "backgroundImageDescription": null,
      "rows": [
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 6,
              "blocks": [
