      "rows": [
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Headline",
                  "text": "Before you sign up",
                  "level": "h2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Faq",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "question": "Is it actually free?",
                      "answer": "<p>Yes — one page, no card, no trial. You'll get a short run of follow-up emails afterwards, and you can leave at any point.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "question": "Do I need a diagnosis to use it?",
                      "answer": "<p>No. It's built for the stage before one, when you're trying to describe what's happening clearly enough to be taken seriously.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "question": "My appointment is tomorrow. Is it too late?",
                      "answer": "<p>No. Fill in the symptom section tonight — even a few dated notes change how the conversation goes.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "question": "What happens to my email address?",
                      "answer": "<p>It's used to send you the checklist and a few follow-up emails. Nothing else, and unsubscribing takes one click.</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tone": "footer",
      "backgroundImageDescription": null,
      "rows": [
        {
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": 12,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "Text",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "html": "<p>No spam. Unsubscribe any time. This is help with preparing for an appointment — it isn't medical advice, and it doesn't replace talking to a clinician.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
